# One field per line: fieldKey | Heading | placeholder | flags
# Line order is display order. The Heading is the exact md heading the importer matches.
# flags (optional, comma separated): rating, rating-or-unknown, required
name = Standard review

gameplay | Gameplay | Tell me about the gameplay... is it good or shit
story | Story | Once upon a time there was a story and it goes like this.
setting | Setting | Whats the setting of the game
music | Music/Audio | Thoughts on the music/audio was it poppin
voiceActing | Voice Acting | Thoughts on the voice acting...
alternateTitles | Alternate Titles | <Alternate title here>
achievements | Achievements | Notable achievements...
replayability | Replay-ability out of 10 | Replay-ability out of 10... | rating-or-unknown
finalRating | Final Rating | Final rating (number) | rating, required
conclusion | Conclusion | Final thoughts / conclusion...
